{"articleNo":"101878","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=101878&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2014 러시아 정부초청장학생 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.02.28","hit":"3046","attachments":[{"name":"러시아 정부초청.zip","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=101878&attachNo=72270"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">러시아정부에서는 아래와 같이 정부초청장학생을 선발코자 하오니 관심있는 학생들의 참여 바랍니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014 러시아 정부초청장학생 선발 요강</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 선발 인원 : 18명 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">? 학사 또는 석사과정 : 14명 ? 박사과정 : 4명 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">※국립국제교육원에서는 1차 서류전형을 통해 장학생후보자 18명을 선발하고, 선발?추천한 장학생후보자를 대상으로 러시아정부/대학에서 심사하여 최종 확정함.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 전공별 선발 분야</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 전공분야 리스트에 기입된 모든 분야.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">※</span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">석/박사 지원자는 소지한 학위(전공)와 동일하거나 밀접하게 관련 있는 전공만 지원 가능</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 장학금 지급기간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 학사 4년, 석사 2년, 박사 3년</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 장학금 지급 내역</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 장학기간 학비 면제(웹 사이트에서 면제되는 학과만 해당.) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ 기숙사비, 항공료, 의료보험료 등 기타비용은 본인 부담이며, 생활비로 월 US$250의 개인 경비가 소요됨. 특히, 러시아 도착시 현지교통비로 US$250, 매년 신체검사비 US$250를 부담해야함. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 지원자격 및 기타 사항: 붙임1 참조</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 1.2014 러시아정부초청장학생 선발요강 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 1-1.2014 Russian government scholarships 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 2. 2014 러시아정부초청장학생 신청서A 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 3.Application form 2014 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 4. 2014 러시아 지원자 DB양식 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 5.LIST of Specialties Codes 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 6.step by step 1부. 끝.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
